    <panel_attributes>style=plain
fontsize=18
Ebene 0 FSM — ActiveRegion / Error / Estop / ConnectionLost (Implementierung Team 3-3)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>

  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>20</x>
      <y>620</y>
      <w>1100</w>
      <h>120</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>fontsize=11
Legende Ebene 0
--
• Start (Fsm): ActiveRegion + Idle (L1) | Ebene 1 lebt nur in ActiveRegion
• H* = Deep History: nach Error / ConnectionLost → letzter L1-Zustand (Idle, Running, Service, …)
• Estop-Reset: immer Idle (shallow), WPs + Rutsche geleert — kein H*
• Error: RESET quittieren → START → ActiveRegion(H*) | Motor ggf. wieder an
• ConnectionLost: WPs bleiben, Service-Phase in ServiceCalibRegistry
• Code: level0/*.cpp, estop/EStopSubStates.cpp</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>

  <!-- ========== OUTER COMPOSITE Ebene 0 ========== -->
  <element>
    <id>UMLState</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>20</x>
      <y>50</y>
      <w>1060</w>
      <h>550</h>
